+
+    // P2 EXPERIMENT (rttc benchmark, not upstream ns-3): bound worst-case
+    // memory growth. A wholesale clear (rather than an LRU/piecemeal evict)
+    // is simplest to prove correct -- it can never serve a stale entry for
+    // a key that was actually evicted-and-changed (nothing here ever
